# - load_model returns DeepSeekModel for DeepSeek platform config
# - DeepSeekModel query and stream methods handle tool calls and normal messages
# - cli.new includes DeepSeek in platform choices
# - cli.chat calls load_model with default model_name and uses CodeAgent
